/* Opt-in T096 layout for a new PKI identity. Install only on a unit that
 * passes the full blank-region preflight. Never apply this to a legacy T096.
 * Leaving NVS and /lfs at their original offsets is not an upgrade guarantee:
 * this extended application occupies the historical append journal. */
/delete-node/ &mt_pki_history;
&code_partition { reg = <0x00026000 0x000aa000>; };
